            <div class="cadre-badge">Entry Floor / Operational Support</div>
            <p><strong>Standard Designations:</strong> Multi-Tasking Staff (MTS), Railway Track Maintainer Gr-IV, Peon, Daftary, Messenger, Mali, Hospital Attendant, Helper.</p>
            <p><strong>Role & Mandate:</strong> Physical record-keeping, office upkeep, non-clerical operational assistance, routine equipment operation, and maintenance in field units.</p>
            <span class="cadre-footer">7th CPC Entry: ₹18,000 | 8th CPC (2.28x): <strong>₹41,040</strong></span>
          </div>

